| 1 | `[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1]` |
| 2 | `[0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]` |
| 3 | `[0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]` |
| 4 | `[0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2]` |
| 5 | `[0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3]` |
| 6 | `[0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 4]` |
\image(figures/scs_original.svg)
// result_end
