| case | actual output | LCS |
| ---: | --- | ---: |
| 0 | `[]` | 0 |
| 1 | `[1, 2]` | 0 |
| 2 | `[3, 4, 1, 2]` | 0 |
| 3 | `[1, 1, 1]` | 2 |
Complete table cap rejected: true.
\image(figures/scs_controls.svg)
// result_end
